Out of scope for this Intent
============================

Unless the existing Intent process requires otherwise, consider these outside the
initial feature boundary:

- requesting membership in the selected Entra group
- SailPoint entitlement approval workflow
- directly adding users to Entra groups
- creating arbitrary Entra groups from this feature
- redesigning the entire Toolkit/Gateway lifecycle
- agent business logic
- tool implementation
- environment-promotion implementation itself

The design may identify dependencies on these capabilities, but they should not
automatically become part of this feature.

